# The fast, repo-wide checks. These need only the root's own dependencies, so
# they run in about a second and cannot be affected by whether the individual
# templates have been installed.
#
# Deliberately not here: each template's own typecheck, lint, test and build.
# Those need node_modules inside every template, which is minutes of install on
# a clean checkout, so they stay in CI where the matrix installs them once per
# job and runs them in parallel.
npm run validate
npm run format:check
